- `changelogs/v0.8.0/nehmetohme_2026-09-16.log`

Test result: `5860 passed, 316 skipped, 6 deselected` (`uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"`); focused agent suite: `311 passed`; live Astra transport check accepted `reasoning_effort=low` without Chat Completions tools.
